      "writtenOn": "2026-09-08T22:13:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Added a poweronTargetComplete flag to track whether obmc-chassis-poweron@0.target has completed. The flag is set and cleared exclusively within sysStateChangeJobRemoved(), which calls aggregatePowerState() whenever it changes.\n\naggregatePowerState() is now responsible for checking both the leaf chassis states and poweronTargetComplete flag. PowerState::On is only published when all leaves report On and the target has completed successfully.",
